{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6499125d-0508-86c3-a0b4-16b23b30edcf",
  "created_at": "2026-01-14T11:42:29-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Diane Conti",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T11:40:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T11:40:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. I'm calling about trash pickup. I need to know the new schedule after the holiday week. Did the days change?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T11:40:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. They can shift by a day after the holidays, yes. What street are you on, or what was your usual pickup day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T11:40:28-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My usual day is Monday. But nobody came this past Monday. And that is the second miss in a row, so two weeks now the bin just sits there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T11:40:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Monday after New Year's and then this Monday. Did you put it out the night before, or early that morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T11:40:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The night before, both times. I put it at the curb, lid closed, like the paper says. Maybe the schedule moved and I did not see it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T11:40:54-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's possible. After the holiday week, routes ran a day behind for a bit, so a Monday pickup might have landed on Tuesday or Wednesday. Is it still sitting there today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T11:41:04-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, still there. Today is Wednesday, right? So it is already two days late. Sorry, I talk fast, I am at work, it is very busy here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T11:41:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can keep up. What do you do there, if you don't mind me asking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T11:41:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am an assistant manager at a store. This week it is unusually busy, so I only have a few minutes on my break."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T11:41:27-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood, I'll be quick. I'm going to log this as a missed pickup so the crew gets a note to come back. Since you can't tell if the day moved, the schedule should be back to normal now, so Monday again. Put it out Sunday night or very early Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T11:41:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So normal Monday from now. And what does that mean, \"back to normal\"? The same as before the holidays?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T11:41:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, same as before the holidays. Your regular day, no more shifts."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T11:41:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And the bin that is out now, I leave it there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T11:42:00-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Leave it at the curb. Someone should come by in the next day or two. If it's still there Friday, call us back and we'll push it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T11:42:09-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I will do that. Do you need my phone number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T11:42:13-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T11:42:15-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 401-555-0157."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T11:42:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0157. I've noted it. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T11:42:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T11:42:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good rest of your shift."
    }
  ],
